{"id":1715,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2025年9月15日至27日，中北大学开展了2025级本科军训工作。在军训期间，军训教官积极参与，部分同学在军训和“纪念中国人民抗日战争暨世界反法西斯战争胜利80周年学生军训合唱比赛”、军训汇演中表现出色，圆满地完成了军训工作。为培养同学们无私奉献、团结进取的良好品德，鼓励广大同学积极参与学院相关工作，经学院研究决定，给予航空宇航学院以下同学通报表扬一次。具体名单如下：</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3nRNBYLmnVL4U8MGRVRnzvYo7-bUzWf7olVfnN-DMm-iUzC0gihFp2hmCIa0LShkLYyDL1ysLzv8L8lDLmLsL8W2nRUDnl-sLR98Mm6Vnm6Fn7CbM4LsM4VFLlr2nSbaptveo4Oeq2xZ_ShXptQ0g47aMRL0MzNbMYbw62k8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1043&nid=5997&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1B36271743E62373BFD46EB708467EF7/DF973771/1EFE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 576px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3nRNBYLmnVL4U8MGRVRnzvYo7-bUzWf7olVfnN-DMm-iUzC0gihFp2hmCIa0LShkLYyDL1ysLzv8L8lDLmLsL8W2nRUDnl-sLR98Mm6Vnm6Fn7CbM4LsM4VFLlr2nSbaptveo4Oeq2xZ_ShXptQ0g47aMRL0MzNbMYbw62k8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1043&nid=5997&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3L49BinNrVMRGDUGlQkL4TfnR-8LzCf8LRLPoRVVL8Cbnz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyanky8LYhVL4-sMR9DUm-DL77sUmv8oRnkn7lYL4NiL8rFMRL4ozr2M4QFozLaM1baptveo4Oeq2xZ_ShXptQ0g47aMRL0MzNbMYbw62k8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1043&nid=5997&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D0D43E327486B260A7B7484BDE23953E/43395F76/9306\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 580px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3L49BinNrVMRGDUGlQkL4TfnR-8LzCf8LRLPoRVVL8Cbnz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyanky8LYhVL4-sMR9DUm-DL77sUmv8oRnkn7lYL4NiL8rFMRL4ozr2M4QFozLaM1baptveo4Oeq2xZ_ShXptQ0g47aMRL0MzNbMYbw62k8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1043&nid=5997&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3M4vBsL4r7LlWVnGRGDUN-iLzrRMznfVMR67o77DLN78n770gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVLYyZn1hVUmQ7U49YLRLaLNC8nzrfLmlbL4CsnRNYUlnFnmQRo7CDMmnFLm9bMSbaptveo4Oeq2xZ_ShXptQ0g47aMRL0MzNbMYbw62k8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1043&nid=5997&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2E38FEB6DC820302F4E5A259367D92AD/F6C8F664/2895\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 575px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3M4vBsL4r7LlWVnGRGDUN-iLzrRMznfVMR67o77DLN78n770gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVLYyZn1hVUmQ7U49YLRLaLNC8nzrfLmlbL4CsnRNYUl